# Go
*.test
*.out
/coverage.out
/cover.html
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Local-dev Go workspace, generated on demand by `make workspace` when umbra
# is checked out side by side at ../umbra (ward#326). Never committed: a
# tracked `use (. ../umbra)` would break single-repo builds in CI and the
# warded engineer clone, where the sibling is absent and `go build` would fail.
/go.work
/go.work.sum

# Build artifacts
/bin/
/dist/
/ward

# mkdocs build output
/site/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Python bytecode and cache directories. ward ships no Python runtime and this
# keeps stray tooling artifacts out of git.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local dev overrides
*.local

# Stray Python lockfile: ward ships no Python and denies bare `uv` (cmd/ward/hook.go).
# A uv.lock only ever lands here if a uv-using tool (e.g. pre-commit's Python hook
# envs) drops one in the tree. Never tracked - keep it invisible rather than churn.
uv.lock
